{
  "name": "fighter-1p",
  "id": "2026-09-19-211144657-street-fighter-but-with-batman-a-qljlj3",
  "players": 1,
  "type": "fighter",
  "spec": {
    "title": "GOTHAM CLASH",
    "oneLiner": "Batman and the Flash collide in a best-of-three rooftop showdown of punches, blocks and specials.",
    "genre": "fighting",
    "mechanics": [
      "The player controls Batman in a single-player best-of-three match against CPU Flash; the foundation remains shared-screen and damage begins after the brief round banner while movement is immediately available.",
      "Left/Right move and face the opponent; Up jumps; Down crouches. Holding away from the opponent guards automatically, with standing guard blocking mid/high attacks and crouch guard blocking mid/low attacks.",
      "A performs a light punch on the ground or air punch in the air; Down+A performs a low sweep. B performs a heavy kick on the ground or air heavy kick in the air; Down+B spends 60 meter for Batman's batarang projectile special.",
      "Every attack has startup, one active hit window and recovery: light 5/3/10 frames, heavy 11/5/21, sweep 9/5/20, air light 4/6/10, air heavy 8/6/14, batarang 13/5/22. Attacks deal damage once per target, visibly telegraph their active pose, and leave the attacker punishable during recovery.",
      "Successful hits cause hitstop, hitstun and pushback; blocked hits cause reduced or zero damage with guard feedback. A hit interrupts attacks, while a missed special remains punishable. Batman's meter increases through active fighting and is capped at 100; the batarang requires 60 and visibly consumes it.",
      "Flash CPU uses a bounded decision cadence, approaches during recovery phases, blocks from the correct side, jumps occasionally and uses his always-available speed-dash special with a clear wind-up and horizontal streak. Difficulty is moderate and does not read future player input.",
      "Each round lasts 60 seconds. The fighter with depleted health loses the round; on timeout, higher remaining health wins, with a draw only when health is exactly tied. Round reset clears temporary hitstun, attacks and meter state while preserving match score.",
      "First fighter to win two rounds wins the match. Round wins, knockouts and final victory use distinct banners and sound/flash feedback; the runtime ends once the match result is declared."
    ],
    "artDirection": "256x224 side-view rooftop arena with fighter silhouettes about 52 pixels tall, a clear ground line, small shadows and uncluttered space around combatants. Batman uses a black-and-charcoal cowl with pointed ears, white eye slits, blue-gray highlights, yellow chest emblem and angular cape; idle stance is broad and guarded, walk pose cape trailing, punch extends a gloved fist, kick lifts a boot, guard folds cape and forearms inward, special throws a bright batarang, hurt pose recoils and KO pose collapses. Flash uses a red mask with yellow ear bolts, bright lightning chest emblem, red suit with yellow accents; idle stance leans forward, walk pose has a running arm swing, punch and kick show speed streaks, guard crosses forearms, special becomes a red-and-yellow speed dash, hurt pose trails sparks and KO pose slides back. Use a dark purple-blue Gotham sky, muted building silhouettes, moon and rooftop vents in the background; keep fighters and hit effects high-contrast against it. Use brief white impact flashes, blue Batman batarang trails and yellow-red Flash streaks without obscuring hitboxes.",
    "referenceIntent": {
      "reference": "Street Fighter",
      "preserve": [
        "Side-view one-on-one fighting with close spacing, facing, jumps, crouches, attacks, blocking, hitstun, knockback, rounds, health bars and a timed match.",
        "Distinct fighter silhouettes, readable attack poses, telegraphed specials, recovery windows and best-of-three-style progression."
      ],
      "change": [
        "Use Batman and the Flash as the two recognizable fighters.",
        "Preserve proper fighting moves, directional blocking and character-specific special moves for the full match, not temporary substitutions."
      ]
    },
    "controls": {
      "left": "Move left; hold away from the opponent to guard.",
      "right": "Move right; hold away from the opponent to guard.",
      "up": "Jump when grounded.",
      "down": "Crouch; combine with A for a sweep or B for crouch guard/special input.",
      "a": "Light punch; air light punch while airborne; Down+A is a low sweep.",
      "b": "Heavy kick; air heavy kick while airborne; Down+B spends 60 meter on Batman's batarang special."
    },
    "palette": "arcade",
    "lose": "Lose the match by losing two rounds; a round is lost when health reaches zero or on a timeout with less health.",
    "scoring": "Score 10×damage, +50 for a linked hit, and +500 for each round won; only player-controlled Batman awards attack score.",
    "moderated": false,
